Cell["\<\
The graph reflection (x0,x1,x2,x3,x4,x5)->(x1,x0,x3,x2,x5,x4) maps the \
representative certificate into this one. They are therefore the same \
graph-symmetry orbit, although the vectors are not componentwise equal in the \
fixed edge labeling.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"3876e7cd-92b0-4944-9067-364355e12cdf"],

Cell["\<\
6. Complete momentum-space comparison and scalar power counting\
\>", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"51b5ea37-6c63-4811-bcc9-2980ab591c3a"],

Cell["\<\
The opposite certificate was not inferred only from its region vector. The \
exact graph reflection x0<->x1, x2<->x3, x4<->x5 maps the representative \
factorised polynomial, total vector and momentum routing into the opposite \
attachment. The transported central edge assignment independently satisfies \
plus, minus and transverse momentum conservation at all five vertices. The \
two exact routings are:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"395cbe89-e90a-4c84-81fa-d57be6fc789a"],

Cell[BoxData[
 TagBox[GridBox[{
    {
     StyleBox["\<\"attachment\"\>",
