  "Grid"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->"a0f1df67-cb31-4088-a1b4-da8134acc41d"],

Cell["\<\
The next table separates central edge-momentum valuations from propagator \
virtualities. Entries (a,b,c) denote \
(q+,q-,|q_perp|)~(delta^a,delta^b,delta^c). The x4 and x5 propagators are \
near-on-shell enhanced: cancellation between longitudinal and transverse \
terms raises their virtuality to delta^4. Under endpoint reflection the \
longitudinal-dominated virtuality delta moves from x2 to x3, while the \
on-shell-balanced soft-collinear edge moves from x3 to x2. Neither edge is a \
Glauber propagator.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"7a4d4d35-141a-4ec8-94b9-7899e75c4eec"],

